Subject: mediatek: bound HNAT learning work and retain publication fences

Keep packet preparation outside the global entry lock, while rechecking the
slot generation and complete live key before publication. Reuse matching
shadows without allocation and fence unowned slots during a bulk clear.
Filter detailed diagnostic work and report actual sampling gaps without
adding a second hardware counter reader.

